              <tr valign="top"> 
                <td colspan="2" bgcolor="#000000" height="26"> 
                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">
                    <tr> 
                      <td bgcolor="#000000" height="23"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><font color="#e1e1e1"><center><a href="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/creator/creator-kill.jpg"><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/creator/creator-kill-small.jpg" alt="yay" border="0"></a><BR>click for enlarged image</center></P><P>Was a fun fight, and long overdue. </P><P><center><BR><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/creator/trinket.jpg"><BR><b>Bonquisha</b></P><P><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/creator/shield.jpg"><BR><b>Catlynne</b></P><P><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/creator/mournful.jpg"><BR></center></P><P><BR>Anyhow, over the past week killed Tormax, Lord Yelinak, Ring of Slime, and a bunch of other random stuff I can't remember atm.  Interesting past few weeks to say the least :)  </P><P>Next update: 2003~<BR></font></font></td>
