                        <div align="right"><font size="1" color="#CCCCCC" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">8/12/2002 1:26:24 PM PST</font><font size="1" color="#999999" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div>
