                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">
                    <tr> 
                      <td bgcolor="#000000" height="23"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><font color="#e1e1e1">With that being said, click to get a full size version :)<BR><center><BR>pictures busted atm, fixed soon! :(<BR></center><BR>With that being said, all in all, a great day and a nice learning experience clearing the entire Plane of Growth and downing Tunare for the first time on Sullon Zek.  Good job everyone and props to the people who stuck it out clearing the place for 12+ hours during the day.  Also, Grats to Webbis on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=7040" target="_new">Petrified Heartwood Flamberge</a> Zaza on your <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=12308" target="_new">Fists of Nature</a> Bizanich on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=7026" target="_new">Golden Leaf Earing</a> and Morgan on your new <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=12726" target="_new">Girdle of Living Thorns</a>.  Awesome night guys and a big FU to the people who claimed Tunare would never die on SZ due to faction trains and so forth in Plane of Growth.  </P><P>Here's some pictures of other fun things we did as well this weekend.<BR><center><BR>pictures busted atm, fixed soon! :(<BR></center></P><P>Grats Loresyther on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=12645">Ssraeshzian Longbow</a> and Rodrego on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=13247">Corrupted Skull Earing</a> and <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=8065">Braided Strands of Corrupted Mana</A></P><P><BR><center><BR>pictures busted atm, fixed soon! :(<BR></center></P><P>Grats Morgan on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=12012">Band of Disrupted Auoras</a> and grats Bonquisha on <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=11980">Scorched Silver Pauldrons</A></P><P>Lots of fun, and Cursed dies soon :)  Make sure to keep checking for updates as soon as I become unlazy :p</P><P><BR></font></font></td>
