                      <td bgcolor="#000000" height="23"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><font color="#e1e1e1">Sorry for the lack of updates recently, been busy in game too much.  Anyhow, had some fun over the weekend, killed a few things and had some fun.  I didn't get screenshots of most the things we did, but I did happen to remember to ss what we killed Monday night, anyhow.<BR><center><BR>pictures busted atm, fixed soon! :(<BR></center><BR>I'll try to update a bit more and maybe even get some Webbis quotes from guildchat in there as well ^_^</font></font></td>
